{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, חֲזָה","hw":"חֲזָה","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֲזָה</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. see, behold (</strong>v. BH<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:20\" href=\"/Daniel.4.20\">Dn 4:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:1\" href=\"/Daniel.7.1\">7:1</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲזַ֫יְתָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:43\" href=\"/Daniel.2.43\">2:43</a> +, -<span dir=\"rtl\">תָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:41\" href=\"/Daniel.2.41\">2:41</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲזֵית</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:26\" href=\"/Daniel.2.26\">26</a> +; 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲזֵיתוּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:8\" href=\"/Daniel.2.8\">2:8</a>; <strong>Pe.</strong> Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמֶחֱזֵא֑</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:14\" href=\"/Ezra.4.14\">Ezr 4:14</a>; Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָזֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:31\" href=\"/Daniel.2.31\">Dn 2:31</a> + 14 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָזַ֫יִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:27\" href=\"/Daniel.3.27\">3:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:23\" href=\"/Daniel.5.23\">5:23</a>; pass. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲזֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:19\" href=\"/Daniel.3.19\">3:19</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>see</em>, have sense of sight <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:23\" href=\"/Daniel.5.23\">Dn 5:23</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>see, behold:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  acc. pers. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:25\" href=\"/Daniel.3.25\">3:25</a>, c. ל v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:27\" href=\"/Daniel.3.27\">27</a>, acc. rei <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:5\" href=\"/Daniel.5.5\">5:5</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <em>see, witness</em> dishonour of king (acc.) <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:14\" href=\"/Ezra.4.14\">Ezr 4:14</a>. <strong>3.</strong>  usually <em>behold</em> in dream or vision (often pt. in periphrast. conj.), acc. pers., <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:20\" href=\"/Daniel.4.20\">Dn 4:20</a>, acc. rei <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:41\" href=\"/Daniel.2.41\">2:41</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:43\" href=\"/Daniel.2.43\">43</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:17\" href=\"/Daniel.4.17\">4:17</a>, abs. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:34\" href=\"/Daniel.2.34\">2:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:4\" href=\"/Daniel.7.4\">7:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:7\" href=\"/Daniel.7.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:9\" href=\"/Daniel.7.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:11\" href=\"/Daniel.7.11\">11</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:21\" href=\"/Daniel.7.21\">21</a>, + <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲלוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:31\" href=\"/Daniel.2.31\">2:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:7\" href=\"/Daniel.4.7\">4:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:10\" href=\"/Daniel.4.10\">10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:2\" href=\"/Daniel.7.2\">7:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:6\" href=\"/Daniel.7.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:13\" href=\"/Daniel.7.13\">13</a>; c. obj. cl. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:8\" href=\"/Daniel.2.8\">2:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:45\" href=\"/Daniel.2.45\">45</a>; <em>behold</em> a dream, acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵלֶם</span>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:26\" href=\"/Daniel.2.26\">2:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:2\" href=\"/Daniel.4.2\">4:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:6\" href=\"/Daniel.4.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:15\" href=\"/Daniel.4.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:1\" href=\"/Daniel.7.1\">7:1</a>. <strong>4.</strong>  pass. = <em>customary</em> (<em>seemly</em>) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:19\" href=\"/Daniel.3.19\">Dn 3:19</a> (so 𝔗 <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.10\">Lv 5:10</a> al., v. Dr).","next":"BDB Aramaic, חֱזוּ","prev":"BDB Aramaic, חִוָּר"}